// ── type kinds (closed) ──
// prompt: the closed set of type kinds; KNominal is a type definition with constraints ({} or <> groups, vic 2026-11-16): equal only
// to itself (by decl symbol and [] args), never to its body; C gives it its body's type (Typer.unfold).
